@startuml
title 用户界面包图

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

package "用户界面包" as UI {
  package "Web管理端\nweb-admin" as WEB {
    [工单管理]
    [催缴待办]
    [信用分明细]
    [规则配置]
    [活动管理]
    [业主管理]
  }

  package "微信小程序端\nweapp-owner" as WEAPP {
    [首页]
    [报修服务]
    [投诉建议]
    [社区活动]
    [消息中心]
    [个人中心]
    [安防通行]
  }

  package "接口表现层\ncontroller" as CTRL {
    [AuthController]
    [UserController]
    [RepairController]
    [ComplaintController]
    [ActivityController]
    [CreditController]
    [RecommendController]
    [PaymentReminderController]
    [PropertyTaskController]
    [AccessController]
  }

  package "数据传输对象\n dto.request / dto.response" as DTO {
    [请求DTO]
    [响应VO]
    [统一返回 Result]
  }
}

WEB --> CTRL : HTTP/JSON
WEAPP --> CTRL : HTTP/JSON
CTRL --> DTO : 接收/返回

note right of UI
职责：
1. 接收用户输入与页面操作
2. 调用后端接口并展示结果
3. 为不同角色提供统一访问入口
end note

@enduml
